              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konu ngat pöytoghintö ropöw lenyaye ompö Ichon pö Tunkun cho toröy asispa taman nko mut nyo pö arawa mut nko odeny, konu ropöwo ngokï cho pö osis mut nko odeny lenyaye nko ropöw cho kïpelöy lenyaye nko ropöwo pagh nko mwaghpa arol lenyaye.”",
